# SW ISP Submit — Required Fields

Before an MSW can submit an ISP/ALFT digital form, required packet fields must be filled. Enforcement lives in `getMissingAlftRequiredFields` (`src/lib/alft-form-rules.ts`) and is checked in:

- SW portal submit UI (`src/app/sw-portal/alft-upload/page.tsx`)
- API submit (`src/app/api/alft/submit/route.ts`)

## Must be completed (non-exhaustive core list)

- **Purpose of this assessment** (`p1_purpose`) — valid option only
- **Is someone besides client answering?** (`p1_other_responder`) — Yes or No
  - If Yes: also require name (`p1_other_responder_name`) and relationship (`p1_other_responder_relationship`)
- **Current Physical Location Type** (`p2_current_type`) — valid select option only (not free-text Caspio prefill)
  - If Other: require `p2_current_type_other`
- **Q6 Assessor/CM assessment site** (`p2_assessment_site`) — always required
  - If Other: require `p2_assessment_site_other`
- **Q10 Is there a primary caregiver?** (`p2_primary_caregiver`) — Yes or No, always required
- **Q11 Living situation** (`p2_living_situation`) — always required
  - If With Other: require `p2_living_situation_other`
- **Q29 Can member self-administer diabetes medication / insulin?** (`p8_diabetes_self_administer`) — Yes or No, **always required** (not only when Diabetes is checked)
- Plus existing SW gates: assessment date, extensive commentary, meds, electronic signature, estimated tier 1–5

## Do not weaken

- Do not allow submit when `p1_other_responder`, `p2_current_type`, `p2_assessment_site`, `p2_primary_caregiver`, `p2_living_situation`, or `p8_diabetes_self_administer` are blank
- Do not treat arbitrary prefill strings (e.g. “Application Location”) as a valid location type — map to a real option or leave blank so the SW must choose
- Keep client + server validation aligned via `getMissingAlftRequiredFields`
- Do not hide or clear Q29 when Diabetes is unchecked on Q28
